    (v_topic_id, 'wary', '/ˈweəri/', '(adj) cảnh giác, thận trọng', 'Some conservationists remain highly wary of human intervention, preferring to let natural selection generate immunity over time.', 'Test 1', 0, 55, NOW() + interval '10055 seconds'),
